From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000002 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Motion Browser Fork Maintainers <motion@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Feb 2025 10:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0003] motion: newtab — Motion default new tab page
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Purpose
=======
Point the default new tab page at the Motion NTP host,
`chrome://motion-newtab/`, and add the `MOTION_NTP_URL` constant for
Motion-side code.

Dependency note: the chrome://motion-newtab host is registered by the Motion
tree (motion/java/src/com/motion/chromium/MotionAgentBridge.java registers the
Motion NTP provider during browser startup; patch 0004 performs the
registration hook). Until the full Motion NTP lands, this URL renders the
fork's placeholder page; NTP_NATIVE_URL still exposes the native NTP.

Rebase notes
============
- UrlConstants.java has historically lived at
  chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/UrlConstants.java, but
  URL constants migrate (some were moved toward components/ntp_tiles or
  chrome/browser/ui/android). If the anchor is gone, find the constant the
  chrome_public_apk NTP path uses at the rebased revision and mirror this
  change there.
- Keep NTP_NATIVE_URL untouched: it is the escape hatch while the Motion NTP
  is under construction.

Honesty note (spec §77)
=======================
Authored against the upstream file layout as documented for 130.0.6723.58.
NOT verified against a real Chromium checkout — rebase expected.
---
 .../org/chromium/chrome/browser/UrlConstants.java              |  8 ++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/UrlConstants.java b/chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/UrlConstants.java
index 4c5d6e7f..9a0b1c2d 100644
--- a/chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/UrlConstants.java
+++ b/chrome/android/java/src/org/chromium/chrome/browser/UrlConstants.java
@@ -8,6 +8,10 @@
 
 public class UrlConstants {
-    // Canonical URL for the new tab page.
-    public static final String NTP_URL = "chrome://newtab/";
+    // Motion (0003): default new tab page. chrome://motion-newtab/ is served
+    // by the Motion NTP provider registered at browser startup (patch 0004 +
+    // motion/java/src/com/motion/chromium/MotionAgentBridge.java). The native
+    // NTP remains available via NTP_NATIVE_URL until Motion NTP lands.
+    public static final String NTP_URL = "chrome://motion-newtab/";
+    public static final String MOTION_NTP_URL = "chrome://motion-newtab/";
     public static final String NTP_NATIVE_URL = "chrome-native://newtab/";
     public static final String BOOKMARKS_URL = "chrome://bookmarks/";
